id: construct
name: Construct
order: 2
optionOf: technological-being
optionEffect: 2
description: >
  Ignore the penalties for the Bruised or Injured Health Thresholds, but reduce your Steadfast Checks by 3 for the Critical Health Threshold and double its penalties. Double the increase to your Maximum Life Points from the effects of Talents.
text: >
  Construct [Passive]: Ignore the penalties for the Bruised or Injured Health Thresholds, but reduce your Steadfast Checks by 3 for the Critical Health Threshold and double its penalties. Double the increase to your Maximum Life Points from the effects of Talents.
  You are Unnatural.

---

# A Steadfast Check failed at Bruised or Injured costs nothing; at Critical it costs twice over, and its Check is made at
# -3 (actor-character.mjs, chat.mjs rollSteadfastCheck). "You are Unnatural" (the user's: Construct's alone) - as Rubbery
# Body's: no Suffocating, no Poisoned, Natural Healing Hands cannot target them.
# Talents' Maximum Life Points doubled: no Talent written yet raises them - the table's until one does.
[passive]
forbid unnatural;
allow threshold.ignore.bruised;
allow threshold.ignore.injured;
allow threshold.double.critical;
steadfast.dice.critical -= 3;
